# Backtest results / large data
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. Bare `data/` matches a directory of
# that name at ANY depth, and the only one in this repo is
# apps/trading-engine/app/data -- source code, not data. That made new files
# there invisible to git, and deploy_engine.sh ships `git ls-files`, so a new
# engine module could have been committed-looking, untracked, and silently
# left out of the image. It already swallowed a test file once.
/data/
backtest_results/
*.parquet
*.h5
*.tsbuildinfo

# MT5 / Broker
*.ex5
*.ex4
terminals/
